//File:    test_params_bench.jtext
//Date:    2026-10-30
//Purpose: Benchmark-tier matrix selection and settings for `jac313_test_cli matrix` (v002), picked with
//         --params <file>.
//
// Big in-memory benchmark tier (SIZE=bench): 005 + 007 at ~1M events/run.
//
// Measures the store hot-path peak ops/sec at amortized scale and records it to the
// results DB under size_label "Bench". Best built in Release:
//
//   ./build/tools/jac313_test_cli all --gcc --release --build-dir build-gcc15-release
//   ./build/tools/jac313_test_cli matrix run --params tests/test_params_bench.jtext \
//       --gcc --build-dir build-gcc15-release --filter none
//
// --filter none = pure in-memory hot path (compare to the historical peak).
// Drop --filter to also measure binary/jText/SQL throughput at 1M events.
// Then: ./build/tools/jac313_test_cli matrix top
//
// selection: one row per package or test to include (include false leaves it out):
//   qlite, jtext, store   a package: every ctest smoke/unit in it
//   001 ... 008, flags, metric_view   a matrix stress test (ported ts_store 001-008 TS/XS + flags)
//   any other name        one ctest test, named without its path
//                         (e.g. jac313_store_binary_persist_smoke)
// settings: one row per key.
//   DISK_TYPE  auto | xssd rssd xx7k xr7k x10k r10k x15k r15k  (results layout label and the machine's disk; x = one
//              disk, r = RAID; a machine sets its own in ~/.config/jac313/disk_type or
//              JAC313_DISK_TYPE)
//   SIZE       smoke | full | bench  (smoke = default; full uses per-test scaling via
//              test_params_full.jtext; bench is test_params_bench.jtext)
//
=== jText File ===
 1. ?# test_params_bench.jtext
 2. ?# 2026-10-30
 3. ?# Benchmark-tier matrix selection and settings (v002)
 4. ?# 0.8

